  triage:title "print_omitted_rows() wording implies --all is already active" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr consolidated QA (BA-REVIEW-QA-1789194730, PR #1425 comment 5645308114, 2026-09-12T10:24:25Z), found during the review-findings stack pass at landed head 9774e113c. print_omitted_rows()'s message \"N more rows omitted (--all)\" reads as if --all were already active. Reword to name the remedy, e.g. \"use --all to see them.\" Not blocking; routed to post-landing backlog as Minor. Distinct from CPR-018 (bound task query output, closed fixed) -- this is a wording-only follow-up on the same function." ;
